From 345bc91179a06040e3eae6cf0f10c2104d58a9f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zachary Yedidia <zyedidia@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:39:39 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] [LFI][X86] Add memory access rewrites (#227511)

This adds memory access rewriting for the x86-64 LFI target using `%gs`
as the base register for rewrites. By using 32-bit register combined
with the sandbox base in `%gs`, memory accesses can be rewritten to be
confined to an LFI sandbox with little overhead. See the documentation
in `LFI.md` for details on exact rewrite sequences.
